From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:30:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/39] gdb: do not hide a lost connection in print_stack_frame

Rethrow TARGET_CLOSE_ERROR instead of swallowing it, which led to an inferior_thread assertion.

diff --git a/gdb/stack.c b/gdb/stack.c
index 5747061c486..a96511aea60 100644
--- a/gdb/stack.c
+++ b/gdb/stack.c
@@ -407,6 +407,9 @@ print_stack_frame (const frame_info_ptr &frame, int print_level,
     }
   catch (const gdb_exception_error &e)
     {
+      /* The connection is gone: do not hide that from the caller.  */
+      if (e.error == TARGET_CLOSE_ERROR)
+	throw;
     }
 }
 
